<view class="screen"><challenge-banner order-id="{{orderId}}" bind:leave="leave" /><view class="heading">给诱惑换个颜色</view><view class="subtitle">{{title || '从眼前的食物图片开始'}}</view><view wx:if="{{status === 'error'}}" class="error-box"><view>图片没能打开，请重试或换一张示例图。</view><button class="soft-button stack" bindtap="render">重试图片</button></view><view wx:if="{{status === 'loading'}}" class="muted">正在处理图片…</view><view class="grid-two section comparison"><view><view class="preview-wrap"><image class="preview" src="{{originalPath}}" mode="aspectFit" /></view><view class="muted">原图</view></view><view><view class="preview-wrap"><canvas type="2d" id="processed" class="preview" /></view><view class="muted">反转后</view></view></view><view class="section"><view class="row"><text>反转程度</text><text>{{ratio}}%</text></view><slider min="0" max="100" value="{{ratio}}" activeColor="#4ba89a" disabled="{{status !== 'ready'}}" bindchange="ratio" /><view class="muted">向右滑动，看看食物的新模样。</view></view><button class="soft-button" bindtap="examples">换一张菜品示例</button></view>


